Subject: mt7915: retain bounded Kite transition history and fallback counters

Add a bounded debugfs event ring and host fallback counters for post-drop
analysis. Events are recorded only at control, lifecycle and recovery
transitions; packet fallback uses counters and never emits per-packet printk
output.

